			"locked": false,
			"text": "Client reads username from Node 1, Node 2, Node 3\n\nNode 1 returns:  { username:\"kartikeya\",  version: 5 }\nNode 2 returns:  { username:\"kartikeya\",  version: 5 }\nNode 3 returns:  { username:\"kart\",       version: 3 }   ← stale,\nwas down during write",
			"rawText": "Client reads username from Node 1, Node 2, Node 3\n\nNode 1 returns:  { username:\"kartikeya\",  version: 5 }\nNode 2 returns:  { username:\"kartikeya\",  version: 5 }\nNode 3 returns:  { username:\"kart\",       version: 3 }   ← stale, was down during write",
