			"updated": 1778630859644,
			"locked": false,
			"text": " Node 3 is down.\n\n Client sends write to Node 1, Node 2, Node 3.\n Node 3 does not respond.\n\n so to maintain the Quorum we need 2 writes\n\n Node 1 stores:\n  {\n    data:    username = \"kartikeya\",\n    version: 5,\n    hint:    \"this write belongs to Node 3, deliver when it comes back\"\n  }\n\n Node 2 stores the actual write normally.",
			"rawText": " Node 3 is down.\n\n Client sends write to Node 1, Node 2, Node 3.\n Node 3 does not respond.\n\n so to maintain the Quorum we need 2 writes\n\n Node 1 stores:\n  {\n    data:    username = \"kartikeya\",\n    version: 5,\n    hint:    \"this write belongs to Node 3, deliver when it comes back\"\n  }\n\n Node 2 stores the actual write normally.",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "IQfoHmsZ",
			"originalText": " Node 3 is down.\n\n Client sends write to Node 1, Node 2, Node 3.\n Node 3 does not respond.\n\n so to maintain the Quorum we need 2 writes\n\n Node 1 stores:\n  {\n    data:    username = \"kartikeya\",\n    version: 5,\n    hint:    \"this write belongs to Node 3, deliver when it comes back\"\n  }\n\n Node 2 stores the actual write normally.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false
		},
