			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1778631591436,
			"locked": false,
			"text": " Key \"username\" normally lives on:  Node 1, Node 2, Node 3\n\n Node 2 down.  Node 3 down.\n\n Sloppy quorum says:\n   \"Write to Node 1 (normal) and Node 4, Node 5 (not normal home)\"\n   Write succeeds with w=2 using Node 1 + Node 4\n\n Node 4 and Node 5 store the write temporarily with a hint:\n   \"this data belongs to Node 2 and Node 3, deliver when they return\"",
			"rawText": " Key \"username\" normally lives on:  Node 1, Node 2, Node 3\n\n Node 2 down.  Node 3 down.\n\n Sloppy quorum says:\n   \"Write to Node 1 (normal) and Node 4, Node 5 (not normal home)\"\n   Write succeeds with w=2 using Node 1 + Node 4\n\n Node 4 and Node 5 store the write temporarily with a hint:\n   \"this data belongs to Node 2 and Node 3, deliver when they return\"",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "rn3YsxEAVgsc_o1hhspNG",
			"originalText": " Key \"username\" normally lives on:  Node 1, Node 2, Node 3\n\n Node 2 down.  Node 3 down.\n\n Sloppy quorum says:\n   \"Write to Node 1 (normal) and Node 4, Node 5 (not normal home)\"\n   Write succeeds with w=2 using Node 1 + Node 4\n\n Node 4 and Node 5 store the write temporarily with a hint:\n   \"this data belongs to Node 2 and Node 3, deliver when they return\"",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false
		},
