			"boundElements": null,
			"updated": 1778632895828,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "    Model                    | Guarantee                        | Leaderless can do?\n    -------------------------|----------------------------------|--------------------\n    Eventual consistency     | Will agree, eventually           | Yes, easily\n    Strong eventual (CRDT)   | Same updates = same state        | Yes, with CRDTs\n    Strong consistency       | Every read = latest write        | Only if w=r=n (impractical)",
			"rawText": "    Model                    | Guarantee                        | Leaderless can do?\n    -------------------------|----------------------------------|--------------------\n    Eventual consistency     | Will agree, eventually           | Yes, easily\n    Strong eventual (CRDT)   | Same updates = same state        | Yes, with CRDTs\n    Strong consistency       | Every read = latest write        | Only if w=r=n (impractical)",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
