			"originalText": "    Model                    | Guarantee                        | Leaderless can do?\n    -------------------------|----------------------------------|--------------------\n    Eventual consistency     | Will agree, eventually           | Yes, easily\n    Strong eventual (CRDT)   | Same updates = same state        | Yes, with CRDTs\n    Strong consistency       | Every read = latest write        | Only if w=r=n (impractical)",
